562:     dataEntities: [Session, User]
563:     securityPrivacyImpact: Refresh tokens are HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Strict, path-scoped, rotated and hashed; refresh requires a non-simple CSRF header; protected requests deny revoked sessions and disabled users immediately.
564:     acceptanceCriteria: Login never returns a refresh token in JSON; refresh rotates the cookie and rejects CSRF omission and replay; a Bearer token populates tenant-aware authentication context; logout revokes the session and the same access token is rejected.
